{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scgpt RNA encoder in a multiprofile setup with avgpool aggregation, comparing it to the previously top-performing scvi_n200 encoder. Validation accuracy (0.5305) and F1 (0.5152) are lower than the scvi_n200 baseline (0.6501 and 0.6275), suggesting the RNA encoder choice may influence performance. However, uncertainty remains about whether other factors, such as aggregation methods or additional components, could further impact results."
}

